# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. That file is gitignored and is read ONLY by
# `wrangler dev` — it is never uploaded. The deployed Worker reads secrets set
# with `wrangler secret put`, so every value here must also be pushed that way
# before it works in production. See README.md.
#
# Use TEST-mode Stripe values here (sk_test_… / the whsec_… printed by
# `stripe listen`), never live ones.

STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
MAILERLITE_API_KEY=...
